	(layer "F.Cu")
	(descr "noknok PicoHub mezzanine contact pads, interface rev 2 (24 Sep 2026), cluster A: 8 flat round pads D2.4 mm on a 3.0 mm grid, copper + mask only (NO paste, ENIG). POWER cluster: A1-A4 = VBUS_PD in one row, A5-A8 = GND in the other, so each row merges into a single copper bar - 4 contacts x 1.5 A = 6 A each way, enough for the 5 A input path. GND row sits ON the hole axis (nearest the board edge), VBUS 3 mm inboard. INCLUDES the M2.5 mounting hole at the origin; place on the hub BOTTOM at the hole position (authored with y negated so the flip puts every pad at its viewed-from-above position). Mates with noknok_Mezzanine_A_PogoPins_BWCD_M2.5.")
	(tags "noknok mezzanine pogo pad PicoHub mountinghole M2.5")
